"### 4.2 固定通信环境变量\n"
""
msgstr ""
"### 4.2 Fixed Communication Environment Variables\n"
""

msgid ""
"在多卡通信情况下：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"In multi-device communication scenarios:\n"
""

msgid ""
"- HCCL通信下（默认场景）：\n"
""
msgstr ""
